## About this placeholder

This is fictional sample content used to verify the **app information page** template while the site is in development. It does not describe a real application. All specifications above are placeholders and must not be reused.

This entry, and every entry marked "sample", is automatically excluded from production builds (see `src/lib/content.ts`) and from the sitemap.

## What a real entry should include

- An accurate short description of the real app
- The developer's real name, with the official store or developer-site link only
- Specifications exactly as reported by that official source (version, size, compatibility) — never invented
- A cover image you have the rights to use, with descriptive alt text
